# No Cursor co-authors

Never add `Co-authored-by` lines for Cursor or any AI/agent identity to git commits.

- Do not include `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Co-authored-by: cursoragent`, or similar trailers
- If tooling injects a Cursor co-author, rewrite the commit without it before finishing
- Commit messages should name only the human git author
